      "updated": 1771653324746,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-> search movies -> select threatre -> show -> tickets\n-> book a ticket\n\nRequirements \n- Users should be able to search for movies by name\n- Users can filter movies by theatre\n- Theatre can have multiple screens\n- Users can select a particular show for a particular movie at a particular theatre \n- No Concurrent booking of the system",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 218,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-> search movies -> select threatre -> show -> tickets\n-> book a ticket\n\nRequirements \n- Users should be able to search for movies by name\n- Users can filter movies by theatre\n- Theatre can have multiple screens\n- Users can select a particular show for a particular movie at a particular theatre \n- No Concurrent booking of the system",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
